19:47.680 --> 19:49.410
Rugilah kalau kita beli mi itu.

19:49.550 --> 19:51.380
Lagipun, mentor kita cuai sangat.

19:51.380 --> 19:51.980
Entah-entah

19:51.980 --> 19:53.590
