21:54.680 --> 21:55.160
Jalan!

21:55.570 --> 21:56.050
Masuk!

21:57.160 --> 21:58.070
Ketua!

21:58.070 --> 21:59.220
Tunggu saya!

21:59.290 --> 21:59.980
Ketua!

21:59.980 --> 22:01.250
Awak yang nak bunuh kucing saya!

22:01.250 --> 22:02.250
Awak orang jahat!

22:02.250 --> 22:03.650
