23:48.210 --> 23:49.610
Baik, saya tak main lagi.

23:50.200 --> 23:51.460
Hidung awak berdarah.

23:52.850 --> 23:53.850
Saya tak apa-apa.

23:57.510 --> 23:58.810
Awak tak apa-apa, awak tak...

23:58.810 --> 23:59.970
